#: ../../source/refs/stamp.lora1262.ref ../../source/stamp/lora1262.rst:2
msgid "Stamp LoRa-1262"
msgstr "Stamp LoRa-1262"

#: ../../source/stamp/lora1262.rst:8
msgid ""
"Stamp LoRa-1262 is an SX1262 LoRa transceiver for the Stamp Series FPC12 "
"interface. ``StampLoRa1262`` selects the current host's FPC12 GPIO "
"mapping, enables the RF switch, and provides synchronous send, receive, "
"and radio configuration operations."
msgstr "Stamp LoRa-1262 是一款用于 Stamp 系列 FPC12 接口的 SX1262 LoRa 收发器。``StampLoRa1262`` 会选择当前主机的 FPC12 GPIO 映射，启用射频开关，并提供同步发送、接收和无线电配置操作。"

