#: ../../source/stamp/lora1262.rst:35
msgid ""
"The supported RF frequency range is 868-923 MHz. Attach a suitable "
"antenna before transmitting. The module's ``SHUT_DOWN`` signal is not "
"part of the Stamp Series FPC12 interface and is not controlled by this "
"driver."
msgstr "支持的射频范围为 868-923 MHz。发送前请连接合适的天线。模块的 ``SHUT_DOWN`` 信号不属于 Stamp 系列 FPC12 接口，驱动不会控制该信号。"

