#: of stamp.lora1262.StampLoRa1262:1
msgid "SX1262 LoRa radio connected through the Stamp FPC12 interface."
msgstr "通过 Stamp FPC12 接口连接的 SX1262 LoRa 收发器。"

#: of stamp.lora1262.StampLoRa1262:3
msgid ""
"Passing ``None`` for a pin uses the current Stamp host's FPC12 mapping. "
"StampC5, StampC6, and StampS3Mini are supported by default. Other hosts "
"can be used when every signal pin is provided explicitly."
msgstr ""
"引脚传入 ``None`` 时使用当前 Stamp 主机的 FPC12 映射。默认支持 StampC5、StampC6 和 "
"StampS3Mini。为其他主机明确提供所有信号引脚后也可以使用。"

